cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper below."
title: "PSBayes: A Bayesian Approach to Estimating Residual Risk of Fuzzing (artifact)"
abstract: >-
  Replication artifact for the ICSE 2027 paper "A Bayesian Approach to
  Estimating Residual Risk of Fuzzing". Contains the raw campaign data for
  eight FuzzBench benchmarks, the notebook that regenerates every table and
  figure, the libFuzzer patch used to instrument the campaigns, and the
  launch scripts and commit pins needed to rerun them.
